    "detailed_description": "<strong>Viral Execution: Survive the Ultimate Challenge!</strong><br>In a world devastated by a deadly virus, only the most cunning and brave will survive. <br>Welcome to Viral Execution, a first-person shooter where ammunition is limited and enemies are innumerable. <br>Do you have what it takes to overcome this extreme challenge?<br><br><strong>The Story</strong><br>Humanity is on the brink of extinction. <br>A virus has transformed most of the population into fierce enemies, and only a few heroes are left to fight. <br>You are one of them. With barely any ammo and your wits about you, you must face hordes of enemies and fearsome mini-bosses.<br><br><strong>Game mechanics:</strong>.<br>The path to survival is brutal:<br><i>Start the level.<br>Eliminate enemies.<br>Die.<br>Repeat......</i><br><br><strong>The Challenge</strong>.<br>Each level is a lesson in trial and error. Until you recognize the best way to eliminate all enemies, manage your ammo and collect antidotes, you will not be able to advance. <br>Will you be able to master each level and unlock the next one?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333950/extras/49e7ef6b1659e8c07d175bf9e7c74edd.poster.avif?t=1721761919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333950/extras/49e7ef6b1659e8c07d175bf9e7c74edd.webm?t=1721761919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333950/extras/49e7ef6b1659e8c07d175bf9e7c74edd.mp4?t=1721761919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ten intense levels: Each designed to test your skills to the max.<br></li><li>Five difficulty modes: From beginner to expert, for a challenge to suit you.<br></li><li>21 unique characters: Choose your hero and fight against the apocalypse.<br></li><li>Epic boss battles: Face the most challenging bosses that will push you to the limit.<br></li><li>Scarce ammo: Manage every bullet carefully, every shot counts.<br></li><li>First or third person: Play from the perspective you prefer.<br></li><li>Weapon customization: Upgrade and adapt your arsenal for each battle.</li></ul><br><strong>Ready for the Challenge?</strong><br>Complete all ten available levels and prove that you can survive this incredible challenge - download it now on Steam and start your fight for survival!<br><br><strong>Viral Execution</strong>: The game that will test your skill and endurance!",
