he apocalypse.<br></li><li>Epic boss battles: Face the most challenging bosses that will push you to the limit.<br></li><li>Scarce ammo: Manage every bullet carefully, every shot counts.<br></li><li>First or third person: Play from the perspective you prefer.<br></li><li>Weapon customization: Upgrade and adapt your arsenal for each battle.</li></ul><br><strong>Ready for the Challenge?</strong><br>Complete all ten available levels and prove that you can survive this incredible challenge - download it now on Steam and start your fight for survival!<br><br><strong>Viral Execution</strong>: The game that will test your skill and endurance!",
